@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000/api/v1
@token = paste-admin-access-token

### 1. What's waiting for a supplier?
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/sourcing/queue
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. Who can supply it? (paste productId from step 1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/sourcing/candidates?productId=PASTE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Raise the PO (supplierId from step 2, orderItemId from step 1)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/purchase-orders/reactive
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "supplierId": "PASTE", "orderItemIds": ["PASTE"] }

### 4. Send it (we phoned the supplier)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/purchase-orders/PO-2610-00001/send
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "channel": "PHONE" }

### 5. Supplier confirmed → note the collectionCode (shown once!)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/purchase-orders/PO-2610-00001/supplier-response
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "response": "CONFIRMED" }

### 6. Part arrives, passes QC (purchaseOrderItemId from the PO detail; boda fee KES 200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/grns
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "purchaseOrderNumber": "PO-2610-00001",
  "collectionFeeCents": 20000,
  "lines": [{ "purchaseOrderItemId": "PASTE", "receivedQty": 1, "acceptedQty": 1,
              "checks": { "correctPart": true, "correctQty": true, "noDamage": true } }]
}

### Purchase order PDF (to send to the supplier)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/purchase-orders/PO-2610-00001/pdf
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
